WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.449
A quick trick for case maths: percentages.

2
00:00:03.549 --> 00:00:06.077
What is 15% of 240?

3
00:00:06.227 --> 00:00:10.533
10% of 240 = 24

4
00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:13.235
5% = 12

5
00:00:13.335 --> 00:00:16.398
10% + 5% = 15%

6
00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:20.094
15% of 240 = 36

7
00:00:20.244 --> 00:00:26.829
Build any percentage from ten, five and one percent. It is faster, and much harder to get wrong.
